# A status read looks an operation id up across every tenant's records.
MODULE: StatusSeesOwnTenantOnlyIgnoresTenant
TARGET: StatusSeesOwnTenantOnly
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: operation records are not scoped to the caller's tenant
PERTURBS: Act

--- FIND
                 /\ seen' = seen \cup {<<c, p[1], p[2]>> : p \in {q \in ops : q[1] = c /\ Allowed(c, q[2], "Read")}}
--- REPLACE
                 /\ seen' = seen \cup {<<c, p[1], p[2]>> : p \in {q \in ops : Allowed(c, q[2], "Read")}}
--- END
